<title>USA: Dow gains more than 100 points.</title>
<headline>Dow gains more than 100 points.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average soared more than 100 points in early morning trading Thursday following a powerful rally in bonds on a positive employment report for June.</p>
<p>At 9:47 a.m. EDT, the Dow index was up 100.20 points at 7,895.58, which eclipsed its June 20 record close of 7,796.51.</p>
